     "text": "**CLINICAL SUMMARY - Bell LLC Medical Group**\n\n**Patient:** Donna Kerr \n**DOB:** 05/18/1967 \n**Sex:** F \n**MRN:** 292246 \n\n---\n\n**Encounters:**\n\n- **2025-03-29:** The patient, Donna Kerr, presented for evaluation of atrial fibrillation/flutter. At this visit, her blood pressure was recorded as 144/83, and her weight was 157 pounds. Physical examination was largely unremarkable except for a mild elevation in her blood pressure. Donna reported no new symptoms, and her atrial fibrillation remains controlled without medication.\n\n- **2024-12-05:** During a follow-up on December 5, 2024, Donna presented with atrial fibrillation/flutter. Her blood pressure was 130/83, and she weighed 158 pounds. Echocardiography results were normal, and she continues to be stable without any new cardiac events. She reports adherence to lifestyle modifications and no recent episodes of palpitations or dizziness.\n\n- **2024-08-13:** On August 13, 2024, Donna was seen for atrial fibrillation/flutter. Her blood pressure was 139/95, and she weighed 148 pounds. Cardiac examination revealed no acute distress, and her atrial fibrillation remains controlled. Laboratory results showed stable renal function and electrolytes. Donna reports occasional mild fatigue but denies any chest pain or significant shortness of breath.\n\n- **2024-04-20:** A lab review appointment on April 20, 2024, noted a blood pressure of 136/90 and a weight of 155 pounds. There were no new findings in terms of atrial fibrillation, and Donna continues to be asymptomatic. The echocardiogram remains normal, and her CHA2DS2-VASc score is 4. She adheres to a low sodium diet and maintains regular follow-up.\n\n- **2023-12-28:** On December 28, 2023, Donna visited for atrial fibrillation/flutter. Her blood pressure was 142/83, and she weighed 158 pounds. Physical exam was generally unremarkable, with no signs of heart failure or significant valvular disease. Atrial fibrillation remains controlled, and she reports no new cardiac symptoms.\n\n- **2023-09-05:** During a visit on September 5, 2023, for atrial fibrillation/flutter, Donna's blood pressure was 130/84, and her weight was 145 pounds. She was evaluated for any new onset symptoms, none were reported. Her echocardiogram and laboratory results were stable, and she continues to be well-controlled with no medication.\n\n- **2023-05-13:** On May 13, 2023, Donna presented with atrial fibrillation/flutter. Her blood pressure was 130/84, and she weighed 153 pounds. She remains asymptomatic with well-controlled atrial fibrillation. Cardiac examination was normal, and her e"
    },
